        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Perfect Harmony of Reflexes and Strategy! Rule the Tennis Court with Your Mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mouse is your weapon! The era of just bouncing a ball back and forth is over. Take total control of your paddle (Bar) and dominate the CPU. Your mouse speed, angle, and timing will decide who rules the court.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Key Features&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real Physics Control: Your mouse speed dictates the power of the ball! Execute a precise slide for a devastating Super Smash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Rotation System: Twist the ball’s trajectory by rotating your paddle with the mouse wheel and buttons. Launch unpredictable Curve Shots that leave the CPU guessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ultimate Comeback: 'Rocket Launch': Is your defense failing? Click both mouse buttons simultaneously to fire a rocket! Hit the ball with a rocket for a thrilling chance at bonus points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-Speed Match System: Be the first to score 5 points to advance. Stronger, smarter CPUs await you as you climb the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;How to Play&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move: Move your mouse to control the paddle and send the ball into the CPU’s territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate: Adjust the paddle’s angle using the wheel or buttons to control the ball’s direction and spin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score: Earn 1 point if the CPU misses! Reach 5 points first to win the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Move: In a pinch, press both mouse buttons to strike the ball with a rocket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the Challenge Now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a new dimension of action paddle games that goes far beyond simple Ping-Pong. How far can your reflexes take you?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Perfect Harmony of Reflexes and Strategy! Rule the Tennis Court with Your Mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mouse is your weapon! The era of just bouncing a ball back and forth is over. Take total control of your paddle (Bar) and dominate the CPU. Your mouse speed, angle, and timing will decide who rules the court.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;Key Features&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real Physics Control: Your mouse speed dictates the power of the ball! Execute a precise slide for a devastating Super Smash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Rotation System: Twist the ball’s trajectory by rotating your paddle with the mouse wheel and buttons. Launch unpredictable Curve Shots that leave the CPU guessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ultimate Comeback: 'Rocket Launch': Is your defense failing? Click both mouse buttons simultaneously to fire a rocket! Hit the ball with a rocket for a thrilling chance at bonus points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-Speed Match System: Be the first to score 5 points to advance. Stronger, smarter CPUs await you as you climb the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;How to Play&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move: Move your mouse to control the paddle and send the ball into the CPU’s territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate: Adjust the paddle’s angle using the wheel or buttons to control the ball’s direction and spin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score: Earn 1 point if the CPU misses! Reach 5 points first to win the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Move: In a pinch, press both mouse buttons to strike the ball with a rocket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the Challenge Now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a new dimension of action paddle games that goes far beyond simple Ping-Pong. How far can your reflexes take you?</p>",
        "short_description": "The player controls the bar with the mouse to pass the ball from the player's side to the CPU's side. If the CPU fails to receive the player's ball, the player scores 1 point. The player can move the bar using the mouse or rotate it using the mouse buttons or mouse wheel.",
